{"id":"media","lemma":"media","pos":"noun","rank":625,"glosses":["half (one of two equal parts of any whole)","synonym of cuarto, half-fanega (a traditional unit of dry measure equivalent to about 27.8 L)","stocking (long thin leggings worn by women)"],"ipa":"/ˈmedja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"medias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/21/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-media.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy de clase media.","en":"I'm middle class.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442771"},{"text":"El trabajo está a medias.","en":"The job is half done.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/68508"},{"text":"Vuelvo en media hora.","en":"I'll be back in half an hour.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550074"},{"text":"Tomás se quitó las medias.","en":"Tom removed his socks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458916"},{"text":"Son las ocho y media.","en":"It's eight-thirty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443481"}]}